<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $63.72 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $63.72 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Thursday announced sales of forex at its latest weekly auction held on May 21st.</p>
<p>				     21 May		14 May</p>
<p>  Amount sold		    $63.72 million	  $80.09 million</p>
<p>  Dollar exchange rate	 85 naira	    85 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
